WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:02.300
Brushes of different
shapes require different

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:07.870
tensions. The head maker
takes the correct brass

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:09.820
mold for the brush shape
she's making.

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:13.500
And inserts the hairs
all the way down into the

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:23.480
mold cavity. She

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:25.640
ties the roots of the
hairs together with the

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:31.680
string. Then removes
them from the mold.

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:37.290
She inserts the brush
head back into the

00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:42.590
ferrule. Then removes
the string.

